OL,3,AUkraine's chief prosecutor resigns over
OL,4,Acall centre corruption scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's chief prosecutor Ruslan
OL,7,FKravchenko has resigned over corruption
OL,8,Fallegations related to illegal call
OL,9,Fcentres in the country.
OL,11,FIt follows a search of his offices over
OL,12,Fthe weekend by Ukrainian
OL,13,Fanti-corruption investigators, who said
OL,14,Fthey had identified a money-laundering
OL,15,Fscheme led by an official in
OL,16,FKravchenko's office.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
