OL,3,AUkraine's chief prosecutor resigns over
OL,4,Acall centre corruption scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his resignation letter, Kravchenko
OL,7,Fsaid he did not want his position to be
OL,8,Fused as a "tool for political
OL,9,Fconfrontation", and referenced an
OL,10,Fearlier post in which he rejected the
OL,11,Fclaims as "unsubstantiated".
OL,13,FCorruption scandals have plagued Kyiv
OL,14,Fthroughout the war against Russia, with
OL,15,Faccusations levelled at several members
OL,16,Fof President Volodymyr Zelensky's inner
OL,17,Fcircle.
